OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers install rain harvesting
OL,4,Asystem
OL,5,
OL,6,FFarmers have installed rain harvesting
OL,7,Fsystems to improve water quality and
OL,8,Fhelp sites adapt to extreme weather.
OL,10,FThe project by West Cumbria Rivers
OL,11,FTrust (WCRT) worked with nine farms in
OL,12,Fthe Waver and Wampool catchment, North
OL,13,FCumbria, to capture rainwater from farm
OL,14,Fbuildings and store it for later use.
OL,16,FThe containers collect water from farm
OL,17,Froofs which could "help slow peak flows
OL,18,Fand reduce flood risks downstream in
OL,19,Fextreme conditions", the trust said.
