OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers install rain harvesting
OL,4,Asystem
OL,5,
OL,6,FWaver Wampool Project Officer Tasha
OL,7,FPearson said the initiative would aim
OL,8,Fto cut farmers' demand on treated mains
OL,9,Fwater, conserve supplies and lower
OL,10,Futility bills.
